>> Animal := Chinthu chatsopano.
Animal chikafika: ['sound:'] chitani: { :s zake sound := s. }.
Animal chikafika: ['makeSound'] chitani: { Zotuluka lembani: zake sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal chatsopano.
Cat chikafika: ['init'] chitani: { zake sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat chikafika: ['meow'] chitani: { wekha makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
